	(lib_symbols)
	(text "MC68008 core board with Elektor Junior bus.\nSheets are connected by global labels (nets used on more than one sheet) and the +5V/GND power symbols.\nGAL sources: decode.pld (U2) and bridge.pld (U3). Symbols: GAL22V10 = KiCad PAL22V10 (ATF22V10C);\n74LCX07 symbol for the 7407, 74HC14 for the 74HCT14, 74LS573 for the 74HCT573."
